# A local clone of temporalio/helm-charts, kept for reference.
#
# Ignored rather than tracked. Committing the directory recorded it as a gitlink
# (mode 160000) while this repo has no .gitmodules to supply its url, so
# `git submodule update --init --recursive` in the parent repo failed with
# "No url found for submodule path 'infrastructure/temporalio'" and exit 128.
# That broke the AWS CodeBuild INSTALL phase outright, before any of the build ran.
#
# If this ever needs to be tracked, it has to be a real submodule
# (`git submodule add`, which writes the .gitmodules entry) and not a committed
# clone. Nothing in this repo or in the parent build references it today.
temporalio/
